{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TLAhfbiSMaAUfuqwTF1mCh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — vla-ssd\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: CoRL 2026\n5\t- Deadline: Abstract May 26, Paper May 29\n6\t- Format: 8 pages + references\n7\t\n8\t## Core Claims (3 条)\n9\t\n10\t1. **Vision Encoder Dominance**: VLA 中 action-relevant 表征结构由 frozen vision encoder（SigLIP）决定。SigLIP+projector 的 RSA 与 action structure 的相关性（ρ=0.615）远高于完整 VLA（ρ≈0.501, image_mean 聚合）和 standalone vision model（DINOv2 ρ=0.388）。\n11\t2. **LLM Redistributes Action-Relevant Structure (Training-Dependent)**: LLM 降解 distributed image token 的 **geometric alignment**（RSA: 0.615→0.501）和 functional capacity（R²: 0.706→0.683, p=0.001），但 global structure 保留（CKA 单调上升）。**训练后** LLM 学会将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（trained R²=0.731 > projector 0.706, p=0.001），但 **untrained LLM 做不到**（untrained readout best=0.686 < projector 0.706）。Readout concentration 是 learned behavior，不是架构固有属性。\n12\t3. **Training: Routing Without Creating**: VLA fine-tuning 不改变 distributed representation structure（image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20），但提升 readout concentration（trained last_preaction 0.731 >> untrained 0.686，Δ=0.045, bootstrap CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001）。Instruction input 对两者均无影响。综合解读：**Training 的贡献是学习信息路由（routing），而非注入新的 action knowledge（creating）**。\n13\t\n14\t## Paper 主数值基准（image_mean 聚合，公平对比）\n15\t\n16\t| Model / Condition | RSA (image_mean) | Notes |\n17\t|---|---|---|\n18\t| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.615** | Smoking gun, LLM input |\n19\t| VLA trained with-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23 |\n20\t| VLA untrained with-inst | 0.485 | Peak L23 |\n21\t| VLA trained no-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23, identical to with-inst |\n22\t| VLA untrained no-inst | 0.482 | Peak L29 |\n23\t| DINO-V2 | 0.388 | Vision-only baseline |\n24\t\n25\tlast_preaction 数值（trained 0.488, untrained 0.485）放 supplementary 作为 robustness check。\n26\t\n27\t## Functional Probe 数值基准\n28\t\n29\t### Raw Action Prediction R²\n30\t\n31\t| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n32\t|---|---|---|\n33\t| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.706** | Vision encoder output |\n34\t| VLA Trained image_mean L19 | 0.683 | image tokens degraded — ✅ bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 vs Proj |\n35\t| **Trained last_preaction L19** | **0.731** | readout concentration (p=0.001 vs projector) |\n36\t| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.714 | Architecture-intrinsic |\n37\t| **Untrained last_preaction L32** | **0.686** | < projector (0.706) → redistribution requires training (D034) |\n38\t| DINO-V2 (LIBERO-Goal) | **0.712** | ✅ cls_token; DINO ≈ Proj (Δ=0.005, CI=[-0.008, 0.019], p=0.22, n.s.) |\n39\t\n40\t**Three-way ordering**: DINO (0.712) ≈ Projector (0.706) > LLM image_mean (0.683)\n41\t\n42\t**重要发现**: DINO 与 Projector 在 action decodability (R²) 上无显著差异，但 RSA 几何对齐差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 action information 的 presence（probe 可解码）与 geometric alignment（表征空间结构匹配 action 空间结构）是不同维度。论文需区分这两个层面。\n43\t\n44\t### Action-Delta Prediction R²\n45\t\n46\t| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n47\t|---|---|---|\n48\t| VLA Trained image_mean L14 | 0.122 | |\n49\t| SigLIP+Projector | 0.118 | ≈ LLM, CI includes 0 (p=0.04) |\n50\t| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.117 | ≈ projector ≈ LLM |\n51\t| DINO (LIBERO-Goal) | 0.100 | action_delta probe from v2 |\n52\t| DINO (MVP-2 LIBERO-10) | 0.061 | 2× lower than projector/LLM |\n53\t\n54\t**Delta 维度结论**：三者几乎相同（~0.12），远 > DINO (0.06-0.10)。支持 vision encoder dominance（所有 action-delta info 追溯到 SigLIP）。Delta last_preaction 缺失（待补）。\n55\t\n56\t### 聚合口径依赖性（论文必须如实讨论）\n57\t\n58\t| Comparison | image_mean | last_preaction |\n59\t|---|---|---|\n60\t| Raw action: Proj vs LLM | Proj wins (+0.023, CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001) | LLM wins (+0.025, p=0.001) |\n61\t| Delta: Proj vs LLM | ≈ tie (−0.003, CI includes 0) | TBD |\n62\t\n63\t主文用 image_mean（公平聚合），last_preaction 放 supplementary。但必须讨论聚合口径对结论的影响。\n64\t\n65\t## Story Spine\n66\t\n67\t- **Problem**: VLAs 通过 fine-tuning LLM on robot data 实现 impressive performance，但 action-relevant 表征从何而来？业界隐性假设 fine-tuning 注入 new representational knowledge，但无系统性验证。\n68\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Grant et al. 2026 从 behavioral level 发现 visual pathway dominates，但未做 representational decomposition。无人测量过 VLA 各组件（vision encoder / projector / LLM）对 action-relevant 表征结构的独立贡献。\n69\t- **Our framing**: 首次对 VLA 进行系统性 representational + functional analysis——组件级分解 + per-layer probing + action prediction probes，定量揭示 action-relevant 结构的来源和 LLM 对其的变换。发现 vision encoder 是 action information 的通用源头（DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²，但 VL pretraining 赋予 geometric alignment）。LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征但通过**训练依赖的** attention 机制将信号聚合到 readout token——training 教会 routing 而非 creating new knowledge。\n70\t- **Headline result**: \"The frozen vision encoder provides action-relevant representations (RSA ρ=0.615, action probe R²=0.706) that the LLM degrades at the image-token level (R²→0.683) but reconcentrates into a readout token (R²=0.731). This reconcentration is training-dependent (untrained readout R²=0.686 < projector 0.706), while distributed representation structure remains training-invariant (image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, p=0.20). Language instructions affect neither.\"\n71\t- **✅ All core evidence complete.** P1 remaining: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control, plan_010 LIBERO-Spatial (P2).\n72\t\n73\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n74\t\n75\t### C1: 单一 VLA 架构（OpenVLA）泛化性\n76\t- **应对**: Scope 明确限定为 \"OpenVLA-class architecture\"。OpenVLA 是最广泛使用的开源 VLA 之一，findings 对该架构族直接适用。Discussion 中讨论扩展到其他架构的预期。\n77\t- **实验**: 无需额外实验，Limitations 明确标注。\n78\t\n79\t### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\n80\t- **问题**: SigLIP 是 image-text contrastive pretrained，DINOv2 是 self-supervised。RSA gap 可能来自 language-aware pretraining 而非纯 vision encoder 质量。\n81\t- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。新发现加强此论点：DINO 与 Projector 在 action R² 上无差异（0.712 vs 0.706, p=0.22），但 RSA 几何差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 VL pretraining 的贡献在于 geometric alignment 而非 information content。\n82\t- **实验**: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control (P1)。区分 \"use VL-pretrained encoder\" vs \"use SigLIP specifically\"。\n83\t\n84\t### C3: LLM 对 action structure 的作用机制\n85\t- **问题**: LLM 到底做了什么？为什么 image token RSA 降低？\n86\t- **应对**: Functional probe 揭示机制——LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征（R² 0.706→0.683, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037]）但通过 self-attention 将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（R² 0.731）。这是 next-token prediction architecture 的自然行为：信息从 context tokens 流向 prediction position。Per-layer curve 的非单调模式（中间层部分恢复）与此一致。\n87\t- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe (Done) + plan_003 per-layer curve (Done)。\n88\t\n89\t### C4: Grant 2026 checkpoint 差异\n90\t- **问题**: Grant 用 OFT fine-tuned，我们用 standard fine-tuning checkpoint。\n91\t- **应对**: 我们用 standard fine-tuning 是更强的测试——如果完全不同的 LLM 权重（random init vs pretrained+finetuned，cos_sim≈0.2）都不改变表征，OFT 更不会。Related Work 明确区分。\n92\t\n93\t### C5: Practical implications / 功能验证\n94\t- **问题**: RSA alignment ≠ task performance。Practical implications?\n95\t- **应对**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe 完成——projector R²=0.706 vs LLM image_mean 0.683（gap=0.023, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001）。LLM readout token R²=0.731 > projector（p=0.001）。Delta probe: projector < LLM 但不显著（CI 含 0）。三个建议：(1) Vision encoder pretraining 是 action info 关键；(2) Image-level tasks 用 projector output；(3) LLM 的价值在于 readout concentration。\n96\t- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 Done（含 bootstrap CI + DINO 三方对比）。\n97\t\n98\t### C6: 聚合方式伪影（已解决）\n99\t- **问题**: SigLIP 用 mean pooling，VLA 用 last token，比较不公平。\n100\t- **应对**: ✅ 已用 image_mean 聚合验证。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501，仍远低于 SigLIP 0.615（gap=0.114）。两种聚合方式结果一致（last_preaction 0.488 vs image_mean 0.501）。主文使用 image_mean 保证公平，last_preaction 放 supplementary。\n101\t\n102\t## Key Evidence Inventory\n103\t\n104\t| Evidence | Claim | Status |\n105\t|----------|-------|--------|\n106\t| SigLIP+Projector RSA=0.615 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n107\t| Full VLA RSA ≈ 0.501 (image_mean, 4 conditions) | C2, C3 | ✅ Done |\n108\t| DINO RSA=0.388 | C1 | ✅ Done |\n109\t| 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks: trained ≈ untrained | C3 | ✅ Done |\n110\t| Instruction ablation Δ=0.004 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n111\t| 2×2 matrix Bootstrap CI includes 0 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n112\t| Output head analysis: SigLIP+projector frozen | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n113\t| Per-layer RSA degradation curve | C2 | ✅ Done — non-monotonic, Proj→L1 primary drop |\n114\t| VLA image_mean RSA (aggregation robustness) | C2 | ✅ Done — 0.501 vs SigLIP 0.615, gap=0.114 |\n115\t| Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean) | C3 | ✅ Done — CI includes 0, invariance holds |\n116\t| Functional action probe: Proj 0.706 vs LLM img_mean 0.683 vs readout 0.731 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done — bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 |\n117\t| DINO action probe on LIBERO-Goal | C1 | ✅ Done — R²=0.712, DINO ≈ Proj (p=0.22) |\n118\t| Action-delta probe: Proj 0.118 < LLM 0.122, CI includes 0 | C2 | ✅ Done — BELOW but not significant |\n119\t| No-inst image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 = with-inst, untrained 0.482 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n120\t| Untrained last_preaction: L32 R²=0.686 < projector 0.706 | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — redistribution is training-dependent (D034) |\n121\t| Untrained vs trained last_preaction bootstrap CI | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — Δ=0.045, CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001 |\n122\t| Random instruction control: normal 0.489, random 0.484, shuffled 0.483, empty 0.472 — all within ±0.017 | C3 | ✅ Done — instruction content invariant (plan_008) |\n123\t| CLIP-ViT pretraining control | C1, C2 | 📋 P1 planned (plan_012) |\n124\t| CKA verification: ordering reversal — CKA untrained > trained > proj > DINO | C1, C2, C7 | ✅ Done — RSA-CKA dissociation (plan_009) |\n125\t| LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark | C1, C2, C3 | 📋 P2 planned (plan_010) |\n126\t\n127\t### C7: RSA vs CKA metric dependency — 排序反转（plan_009 已完成）\n128\t- **问题**: CKA 不仅缩小 gap，还**反转排序**。RSA: projector > trained > untrained > DINO。CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO。\n129\t- **数据**:\n130\t  - CKA vs actions: untrained L23 (0.089) > trained L23 (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\n131\t  - CKA per-layer trained image_mean: L0=0.081 **单调上升** to L32=0.098（与 RSA 的非单调模式不同）\n132\t  - CKA last_preaction: L32=0.127（最高，支持 redistribution — readout concentration）\n133\t  - CKA_RDM: last_preaction (0.290) > projector (0.257) ≈ trained (0.260) > DINO (0.241)（部分一致）\n134\t- **应对**: 论文正面讨论作为 finding。关键区分：\n135\t  - RSA 捕捉 **local geometric alignment**（representation 距离结构是否匹配 action 距离结构）→ LLM 降解\n136\t  - CKA 捕捉 **global structure preservation**（整体变换后结构是否保留）→ LLM 保留或改善\n137\t  - **Claim 2 必须明确限定为 \"geometric (RSA) degradation\"**，不能泛化为 \"representation quality degradation\"\n138\t  - CKA last_preaction 最高 (0.127) 与 redistribution narrative 一致\n139\t- **实验**: ✅ plan_009 Done。\n140\t\n141\t## Literature Positioning\n142\t\n143\t- **Grant et al. 2026**: Behavioral level \"visual pathway dominates\" → 我们 representational level 确认 + 定量组件分解\n144\t- **Fang 2025**: \"Fine-tuning erodes VLM reasoning\" → 我们发现 LLM step 本身（不只是 fine-tuning）就降低 visual structure\n145\t- **Hou 2026 (LangGap) / Fei 2025 (LIBERO-Plus)**: \"VLAs ignore language instructions\" → 我们从 representation level 解释 why：instruction text 对表征结构无实质影响\n146\t- **Haon et al. (CoRL 2025)**: Mechanistic interpretability + activation steering on OpenVLA — same venue, same model. Must discuss: their sparse semantic directions vs our geometric analysis are complementary views\n147\t- **Lu et al. 2025**: Linear probing on OpenVLA hidden layers >90% accuracy — methodologically closest, must differentiate (component decomposition vs layer probing)\n148\t- **Rizzardo et al. 2026**: Feature observability/controllability in VLAs\n149\t- **Swann et al. 2026**: SAE-based OpenVLA interpretability\n150\t- **Molinari et al. 2025**: Emergent world representations in OpenVLA\n151\t- **Karamcheti et al. 2024 (Prismatic)**: OpenVLA's architectural foundation, must cite\n152\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b732350-1830-4f16-90a7-d5f99927a642","uuid":"d1088070-7ba2-4cfb-bb4b-f0925b26b912","timestamp":"2026-05-16T01:28:56.797Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T011810/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — vla-ssd\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: CoRL 2026\n- Deadline: Abstract May 26, Paper May 29\n- Format: 8 pages + references\n\n## Core Claims (3 条)\n\n1. **Vision Encoder Dominance**: VLA 中 action-relevant 表征结构由 frozen vision encoder（SigLIP）决定。SigLIP+projector 的 RSA 与 action structure 的相关性（ρ=0.615）远高于完整 VLA（ρ≈0.501, image_mean 聚合）和 standalone vision model（DINOv2 ρ=0.388）。\n2. **LLM Redistributes Action-Relevant Structure (Training-Dependent)**: LLM 降解 distributed image token 的 **geometric alignment**（RSA: 0.615→0.501）和 functional capacity（R²: 0.706→0.683, p=0.001），但 global structure 保留（CKA 单调上升）。**训练后** LLM 学会将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（trained R²=0.731 > projector 0.706, p=0.001），但 **untrained LLM 做不到**（untrained readout best=0.686 < projector 0.706）。Readout concentration 是 learned behavior，不是架构固有属性。\n3. **Training: Routing Without Creating**: VLA fine-tuning 不改变 distributed representation structure（image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, bootstrap CI includes 0, p=0.20），但提升 readout concentration（trained last_preaction 0.731 >> untrained 0.686，Δ=0.045, bootstrap CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001）。Instruction input 对两者均无影响。综合解读：**Training 的贡献是学习信息路由（routing），而非注入新的 action knowledge（creating）**。\n\n## Paper 主数值基准（image_mean 聚合，公平对比）\n\n| Model / Condition | RSA (image_mean) | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.615** | Smoking gun, LLM input |\n| VLA trained with-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23 |\n| VLA untrained with-inst | 0.485 | Peak L23 |\n| VLA trained no-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23, identical to with-inst |\n| VLA untrained no-inst | 0.482 | Peak L29 |\n| DINO-V2 | 0.388 | Vision-only baseline |\n\nlast_preaction 数值（trained 0.488, untrained 0.485）放 supplementary 作为 robustness check。\n\n## Functional Probe 数值基准\n\n### Raw Action Prediction R²\n\n| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.706** | Vision encoder output |\n| VLA Trained image_mean L19 | 0.683 | image tokens degraded — ✅ bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 vs Proj |\n| **Trained last_preaction L19** | **0.731** | readout concentration (p=0.001 vs projector) |\n| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.714 | Architecture-intrinsic |\n| **Untrained last_preaction L32** | **0.686** | < projector (0.706) → redistribution requires training (D034) |\n| DINO-V2 (LIBERO-Goal) | **0.712** | ✅ cls_token; DINO ≈ Proj (Δ=0.005, CI=[-0.008, 0.019], p=0.22, n.s.) |\n\n**Three-way ordering**: DINO (0.712) ≈ Projector (0.706) > LLM image_mean (0.683)\n\n**重要发现**: DINO 与 Projector 在 action decodability (R²) 上无显著差异，但 RSA 几何对齐差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 action information 的 presence（probe 可解码）与 geometric alignment（表征空间结构匹配 action 空间结构）是不同维度。论文需区分这两个层面。\n\n### Action-Delta Prediction R²\n\n| Model | mean_R² | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| VLA Trained image_mean L14 | 0.122 | |\n| SigLIP+Projector | 0.118 | ≈ LLM, CI includes 0 (p=0.04) |\n| Untrained image_mean L0 | 0.117 | ≈ projector ≈ LLM |\n| DINO (LIBERO-Goal) | 0.100 | action_delta probe from v2 |\n| DINO (MVP-2 LIBERO-10) | 0.061 | 2× lower than projector/LLM |\n\n**Delta 维度结论**：三者几乎相同（~0.12），远 > DINO (0.06-0.10)。支持 vision encoder dominance（所有 action-delta info 追溯到 SigLIP）。Delta last_preaction 缺失（待补）。\n\n### 聚合口径依赖性（论文必须如实讨论）\n\n| Comparison | image_mean | last_preaction |\n|---|---|---|\n| Raw action: Proj vs LLM | Proj wins (+0.023, CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001) | LLM wins (+0.025, p=0.001) |\n| Delta: Proj vs LLM | ≈ tie (−0.003, CI includes 0) | TBD |\n\n主文用 image_mean（公平聚合），last_preaction 放 supplementary。但必须讨论聚合口径对结论的影响。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: VLAs 通过 fine-tuning LLM on robot data 实现 impressive performance，但 action-relevant 表征从何而来？业界隐性假设 fine-tuning 注入 new representational knowledge，但无系统性验证。\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Grant et al. 2026 从 behavioral level 发现 visual pathway dominates，但未做 representational decomposition。无人测量过 VLA 各组件（vision encoder / projector / LLM）对 action-relevant 表征结构的独立贡献。\n- **Our framing**: 首次对 VLA 进行系统性 representational + functional analysis——组件级分解 + per-layer probing + action prediction probes，定量揭示 action-relevant 结构的来源和 LLM 对其的变换。发现 vision encoder 是 action information 的通用源头（DINO ≈ SigLIP in R²，但 VL pretraining 赋予 geometric alignment）。LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征但通过**训练依赖的** attention 机制将信号聚合到 readout token——training 教会 routing 而非 creating new knowledge。\n- **Headline result**: \"The frozen vision encoder provides action-relevant representations (RSA ρ=0.615, action probe R²=0.706) that the LLM degrades at the image-token level (R²→0.683) but reconcentrates into a readout token (R²=0.731). This reconcentration is training-dependent (untrained readout R²=0.686 < projector 0.706), while distributed representation structure remains training-invariant (image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 ≈ untrained 0.485, p=0.20). Language instructions affect neither.\"\n- **✅ All core evidence complete.** P1 remaining: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control, plan_010 LIBERO-Spatial (P2).\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n### C1: 单一 VLA 架构（OpenVLA）泛化性\n- **应对**: Scope 明确限定为 \"OpenVLA-class architecture\"。OpenVLA 是最广泛使用的开源 VLA 之一，findings 对该架构族直接适用。Discussion 中讨论扩展到其他架构的预期。\n- **实验**: 无需额外实验，Limitations 明确标注。\n\n### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\n- **问题**: SigLIP 是 image-text contrastive pretrained，DINOv2 是 self-supervised。RSA gap 可能来自 language-aware pretraining 而非纯 vision encoder 质量。\n- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。新发现加强此论点：DINO 与 Projector 在 action R² 上无差异（0.712 vs 0.706, p=0.22），但 RSA 几何差异显著（0.388 vs 0.615）。说明 VL pretraining 的贡献在于 geometric alignment 而非 information content。\n- **实验**: plan_012 CLIP-ViT control (P1)。区分 \"use VL-pretrained encoder\" vs \"use SigLIP specifically\"。\n\n### C3: LLM 对 action structure 的作用机制\n- **问题**: LLM 到底做了什么？为什么 image token RSA 降低？\n- **应对**: Functional probe 揭示机制——LLM 降解分布式 image token 表征（R² 0.706→0.683, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037]）但通过 self-attention 将 action 信号 concentrate 到 readout token（R² 0.731）。这是 next-token prediction architecture 的自然行为：信息从 context tokens 流向 prediction position。Per-layer curve 的非单调模式（中间层部分恢复）与此一致。\n- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe (Done) + plan_003 per-layer curve (Done)。\n\n### C4: Grant 2026 checkpoint 差异\n- **问题**: Grant 用 OFT fine-tuned，我们用 standard fine-tuning checkpoint。\n- **应对**: 我们用 standard fine-tuning 是更强的测试——如果完全不同的 LLM 权重（random init vs pretrained+finetuned，cos_sim≈0.2）都不改变表征，OFT 更不会。Related Work 明确区分。\n\n### C5: Practical implications / 功能验证\n- **问题**: RSA alignment ≠ task performance。Practical implications?\n- **应对**: ✅ plan_011 functional probe 完成——projector R²=0.706 vs LLM image_mean 0.683（gap=0.023, bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001）。LLM readout token R²=0.731 > projector（p=0.001）。Delta probe: projector < LLM 但不显著（CI 含 0）。三个建议：(1) Vision encoder pretraining 是 action info 关键；(2) Image-level tasks 用 projector output；(3) LLM 的价值在于 readout concentration。\n- **实验**: ✅ plan_011 Done（含 bootstrap CI + DINO 三方对比）。\n\n### C6: 聚合方式伪影（已解决）\n- **问题**: SigLIP 用 mean pooling，VLA 用 last token，比较不公平。\n- **应对**: ✅ 已用 image_mean 聚合验证。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501，仍远低于 SigLIP 0.615（gap=0.114）。两种聚合方式结果一致（last_preaction 0.488 vs image_mean 0.501）。主文使用 image_mean 保证公平，last_preaction 放 supplementary。\n\n## Key Evidence Inventory\n\n| Evidence | Claim | Status |\n|----------|-------|--------|\n| SigLIP+Projector RSA=0.615 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n| Full VLA RSA ≈ 0.501 (image_mean, 4 conditions) | C2, C3 | ✅ Done |\n| DINO RSA=0.388 | C1 | ✅ Done |\n| 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks: trained ≈ untrained | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| Instruction ablation Δ=0.004 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| 2×2 matrix Bootstrap CI includes 0 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| Output head analysis: SigLIP+projector frozen | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\n| Per-layer RSA degradation curve | C2 | ✅ Done — non-monotonic, Proj→L1 primary drop |\n| VLA image_mean RSA (aggregation robustness) | C2 | ✅ Done — 0.501 vs SigLIP 0.615, gap=0.114 |\n| Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean) | C3 | ✅ Done — CI includes 0, invariance holds |\n| Functional action probe: Proj 0.706 vs LLM img_mean 0.683 vs readout 0.731 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done — bootstrap CI=[0.011, 0.037], p=0.001 |\n| DINO action probe on LIBERO-Goal | C1 | ✅ Done — R²=0.712, DINO ≈ Proj (p=0.22) |\n| Action-delta probe: Proj 0.118 < LLM 0.122, CI includes 0 | C2 | ✅ Done — BELOW but not significant |\n| No-inst image_mean RSA: trained 0.501 = with-inst, untrained 0.482 | C3 | ✅ Done |\n| Untrained last_preaction: L32 R²=0.686 < projector 0.706 | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — redistribution is training-dependent (D034) |\n| Untrained vs trained last_preaction bootstrap CI | C2, C3 | ✅ Done — Δ=0.045, CI=[0.032, 0.058], p<0.0001 |\n| Random instruction control: normal 0.489, random 0.484, shuffled 0.483, empty 0.472 — all within ±0.017 | C3 | ✅ Done — instruction content invariant (plan_008) |\n| CLIP-ViT pretraining control | C1, C2 | 📋 P1 planned (plan_012) |\n| CKA verification: ordering reversal — CKA untrained > trained > proj > DINO | C1, C2, C7 | ✅ Done — RSA-CKA dissociation (plan_009) |\n| LIBERO-Spatial cross-benchmark | C1, C2, C3 | 📋 P2 planned (plan_010) |\n\n### C7: RSA vs CKA metric dependency — 排序反转（plan_009 已完成）\n- **问题**: CKA 不仅缩小 gap，还**反转排序**。RSA: projector > trained > untrained > DINO。CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO。\n- **数据**:\n  - CKA vs actions: untrained L23 (0.089) > trained L23 (0.083) > projector (0.081) > DINO (0.066)\n  - CKA per-layer trained image_mean: L0=0.081 **单调上升** to L32=0.098（与 RSA 的非单调模式不同）\n  - CKA last_preaction: L32=0.127（最高，支持 redistribution — readout concentration）\n  - CKA_RDM: last_preaction (0.290) > projector (0.257) ≈ trained (0.260) > DINO (0.241)（部分一致）\n- **应对**: 论文正面讨论作为 finding。关键区分：\n  - RSA 捕捉 **local geometric alignment**（representation 距离结构是否匹配 action 距离结构）→ LLM 降解\n  - CKA 捕捉 **global structure preservation**（整体变换后结构是否保留）→ LLM 保留或改善\n  - **Claim 2 必须明确限定为 \"geometric (RSA) degradation\"**，不能泛化为 \"representation quality degradation\"\n  - CKA last_preaction 最高 (0.127) 与 redistribution narrative 一致\n- **实验**: ✅ plan_009 Done。\n\n## Literature Positioning\n\n- **Grant et al. 2026**: Behavioral level \"visual pathway dominates\" → 我们 representational level 确认 + 定量组件分解\n- **Fang 2025**: \"Fine-tuning erodes VLM reasoning\" → 我们发现 LLM step 本身（不只是 fine-tuning）就降低 visual structure\n- **Hou 2026 (LangGap) / Fei 2025 (LIBERO-Plus)**: \"VLAs ignore language instructions\" → 我们从 representation level 解释 why：instruction text 对表征结构无实质影响\n- **Haon et al. (CoRL 2025)**: Mechanistic interpretability + activation steering on OpenVLA — same venue, same model. Must discuss: their sparse semantic directions vs our geometric analysis are complementary views\n- **Lu et al. 2025**: Linear probing on OpenVLA hidden layers >90% accuracy — methodologically closest, must differentiate (component decomposition vs layer probing)\n- **Rizzardo et al. 2026**: Feature observability/controllability in VLAs\n- **Swann et al. 2026**: SAE-based OpenVLA interpretability\n- **Molinari et al. 2025**: Emergent world representations in OpenVLA\n- **Karamcheti et al. 2024 (Prismatic)**: OpenVLA's architectural foundation, must cite\n","numLines":152,"startLine":1,"totalLines":152}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DKynnckzxFiHGcfisUS2X9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have both the experiment data and the paper framing. Let me analyze the key information:\n\n**Three Core Claims:**\n1. Vision Encoder Dominance - VL-pretrained encoders (SigLIP, CLIP) dominate action-relevant representation\n2. LLM Redistributes - LLM degrades distributed image token geometric alignment but concentrates to readout token (training-dependent)\n3. Training: Routing Without Creating - Fine-tuning doesn't change distributed representation, but improves readout concentration\n\n**Two Experiments:**\n1. CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control - Shows CLIP ≈ SigLIP >> DINO, generalizing from SigLIP-specific to VL-pretrained encoder dominance\n\n\n2. LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation - Replicates all findings on a second benchmark, with SigLIP showing the strongest RSA scores around 0.615 while DINO trails at 0.388, and functional probes confirming that trained readout tokens achieve the highest predictive power at 0.731 R²\n\n—though training effects are minimal and instruction signals barely register. Looking at the control comparisons, CLIP and SigLIP perform similarly (p=0.08) while both substantially outperform DINO (p=0.001), and the LIBERO-Spatial benchmark fully replicates these patterns with nearly identical effect sizes. Now I'm structuring the full LaTeX paper with sections for abstract, introduction, related work, methods, and a detailed experiments section covering the vision encoder dominance findings.\n\nI need to verify the output directory and write the complete paper using all the numbers from the experiment data and framing document without inventing any results.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11673,"cache_read_input_tokens":23061,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input